byid['C-SA23-forms-009']['fate']='EGA IV3 (1966), Theorem9.7.7 printed p79 gives local constructibility of geometric irreducibility, connectedness, reducedness and integrality. Theorems12.2.1–12.2.4 printed pp179–183 give the precise proper-flat sheaf and scheme openness results, retaining equidimensionality/no-embedded-component hypotheses where stated. These statements were opened and read; missing manuscript lists are still not supplied as quotations.'
