byid['C-SA23-forms-054']['fate']+=' Ando–Blumberg–Gepner–Hopkins–Rezk2014, Definition4.4 and Theorems4.2/4.6, supplies a precise coherent Thom-algebra/orientation framework. It does not settle the manuscript’s weakest intended H-space axioms.'
