byid['C-SA23-forms-069']['fate']='The finite-projective comparison is established: Rinehart’s projective PBW statement is exactly restated in Huebschmann2008 Theorem2.1; Gaitsgory–Rozenblyum, Lie algebroids9.2.2, proves a classical formally smooth groupoid equivalence for locally projective countably generated tangent modules. Ardizzoni–El Kaoutit–Saracco2023 concerns affine Hopf-algebroid integration adjunctions, a different category. None of these is an exact flat-conormal-only adic theorem. The precise1968 attribution and first circulation were not located in the searched primary sources; this is a bounded identification limit, not a claim that the theorem remains open.'
